{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤング・ギター連載「ろってぃーの\"Road to Guitar Heroine\" 連載1周年記念 川村真洋 生演奏・生配信」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にゲスト出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーのドキュメンタリー映像\n感動しちゃいましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"動画への高評価が723個以上付くと\n乃木坂のライヴでろってぃーがギター生演奏を披露が決まる\nって事だったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早々に達成"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、\n同時視聴者数が5,605人を超えると\n『ギタヒロ!』の2ndシーズンが決まる\nって事だったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも\n早々に達成"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってことで、\nろってぃー\nライヴでギター披露と\n『ギタヒロ!』の2ndシーズン\n本当におめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高評価してくださったみなさん\n観てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、みんな私服だったのに\nなんか系統が自然とよっちゃってましたね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急遽、用意した私服なので\nみなさんの前で着るつもりなく\n買った服だったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でも着て！という声を\nというかコメントがあったので\n次の個別で着ますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は\n舞台版「こちら葛飾区亀有公園前派出所」を\n観に行ってきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの舞台はよく観に行くけど\nこんなに家族連れが観に来ている舞台は\n初めて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと舞台の中でも\nよりアウェイな場だったんじゃないかなって\n思うけど\n生駒ちゃんは堂々としてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌もソロパートが多いけど、落ち着いて歌っててかっこよかった！！\n生駒ちゃんの声質とか歌い方がすごいあのシーンに効いてて、生駒ちゃんにしかできない役なんだなって思った！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って生駒ちゃんに送ったものの一部\nまんまを載っけたけど\nこれが率直な感想でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃん\nあと１週間頑張ってね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんについていろいろ書いたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ストーリーもめっちゃ面白くて\nたくさん笑いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから観に行かれる方は\nお楽しみに～！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完治いたしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/09/13/9270471/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}